From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msvcp90: Export __Wcrtomb_lk everywhere and msvcp110's _Add_vtordisp members and _GetCurrentThreadId.

__Wcrtomb_lk (_Wcrtomb without the locale lock) in msvcp60 .. msvcp120
as in msvcp140 (patch 4549); msvcp110's _Add_vtordisp1/_Add_vtordisp2
members of the stream classes, which the headers declare with empty
bodies (they only give the classes vtordisp fields), and its
details::_GetCurrentThreadId. msvcp120_app forwards.
